      Description: The serpent coils around the hero, turning pressure into guarded breath and restoring resolve after a matched hit.
  - Id: battle_tile_37
    DisplayName: Golden Lion Sun
    Prefab: {fileID: 1162972782420524311, guid: d3c9aceeea9746dcba9235866cf37e42, type: 3}
